OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed father then himself
OL,4,Aafter row - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer killed his father before
OL,7,Ftaking his own life after a "blazing
OL,8,Frow", an inquest has heard.
OL,10,FBrian Wright, 82, was reported missing
OL,11,Fon 20 November last year after missing
OL,12,Fan appointment to take his wife to
OL,13,Fhospital.
OL,15,FHis 52-year-old son Charles Wright took
OL,16,Fhis own life at the family farm near
OL,17,FNewark, Nottinghamshire, two days
OL,18,Flater, and on 25 November Brian's body
OL,19,Fwas found in a shallow grave by police.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
