OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed father then himself
OL,4,Aafter row - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest at Nottingham Coroner's
OL,7,FCourt on Friday heard no third parties
OL,8,Fwere involved, with Brian's death ruled
OL,9,Fas an unlawful killing and Charles
OL,10,Ffound to have killed himself.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
